stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PRE_FLOP: start_new_hand()<br/>emits on_hand_started

    PRE_FLOP --> FLOP: betting complete<br/>deal 3 community cards
    FLOP --> TURN: betting complete<br/>deal 1 card
    TURN --> RIVER: betting complete<br/>deal 1 card
    RIVER --> SHOWDOWN: betting complete

    PRE_FLOP --> SHOWDOWN: _jump_to_showdown()<br/>fold-out (1 left)
    FLOP --> SHOWDOWN: _jump_to_showdown()<br/>fold-out
    TURN --> SHOWDOWN: _jump_to_showdown()<br/>fold-out
    RIVER --> SHOWDOWN: _jump_to_showdown()<br/>fold-out

    SHOWDOWN --> [*]: hand complete<br/>award + pot collection emit

    state PRE_FLOP {
        direction LR
        [*] --> PostBlinds
        PostBlinds --> BettingRound
        BettingRound --> [*]: _is_round_complete()
        note right of PostBlinds
            _post_blinds() uses
            ActionType.POST_SB / POST_BB
            via process_action
        end note
    }

    state SHOWDOWN {
        direction LR
        [*] --> EvaluateHands
        EvaluateHands --> AwardSidePots: phevaluator scores
        AwardSidePots --> EmitPotCollection: collect_winnings(ChipStack)
        EmitPotCollection --> [*]: on_pot_collection_required(winner_seat)
    }

    note right of FLOP
        deal_community_cards() emits
        on_card_detection_required →
        VisionController switches to
        CARD_READING mode
    end note

    note right of SHOWDOWN
        Signals emitted:
        • on_phase_change(SHOWDOWN)
        • on_pot_change (per side pot)
        • on_player_action (each award)
        • on_pot_collection_required(winner_seat)
        Also emitted on FOLD-out:
        • on_pot_collection_required(winner_seat)
        Validation errors emit:
        • on_action_rejected(reason)
    end note